// Round 24: the skull's line work, written out stroke by stroke (pen.js format), in the
// head's own frame (faces +x, origin at the top of the neck). Owner: art.
// The skull's black design shapes stay in scrivener.js (headArt); these are the marks
// that used to be generated by loops: the hatch that carries the dome's shadow into the
// light, the coronal suture, the teeth, and a few hatch clusters on the face.

// the dome: heavy strokes leaving the occipital shadow, each riding the curve of the
// cranium forward and dying to a point in the light; lengths and weights all different
